{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"746818810954121236","content":"Proposition for dming games that require maps. \n1. Make all maps the the battle ship style numbered and lettered grid whenever possible.\n2. Put the map into inkarnate (as a sticker) and the ask a mod or another dm to run your map during your fight.\n3. have every player send the mod or dm their character picture and add it in as a sticker.\n4. use dante to preroll init before all fights. (remember to clear the google sheets doc before you have them roll. if you make a mistake sort by date to remove the ones that are left over.\n5. If possible have a second mod or dm run your iniative with prompts to pretype their turn like last year.\n6.Massive boss fights will likely still use the at range/ at melee system, with some modificatons.","created_at":"2021-02-27T10:25:51.780000Z","edited_at":"2021-02-27T10:29:23.963000Z","id":"815167813316509727","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
